
@hostname = http://localhost:3000



### Registe user


POST {{hostname}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "user",
    "email": "user@test.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Login user

POST {{hostname}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Refresh token

